      summary: Manage Landlord M-Pesa Configuration
      description: |2

        Manage landlord's M-Pesa payment configurations.

        **Supported Payment Methods:**
        - **Send Money**: Direct M-Pesa send money to business
        - **Till Number**: Pay using business till number
        - **Pochi la Biashara**: Pay using Pochi business account
        - **Paybill Number**: Pay using paybill number

        **Features:**
        - Configure multiple payment methods
        - Set default payment option
        - Track configuration verification status
        - Validate M-Pesa numbers

        **Authentication:**
        - Landlord JWT Token required
        - Can only manage own configurations

        **GET**: List all configurations
        **POST**: Create new configuration
      parameters: []
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Configurations retrieved successfully
        '201':
          description: Configuration created successfully
        '400':
          description: Bad Request - Invalid input data
        '401':
          description: Unauthorized - Authentication required
        '403':
          description: Forbidden - Landlord access required
        '500':
          description: Internal Server Error
      tags:
      - Payments
    post:
      operationId: payments_mpesa_config_create
      description: Add new M-Pesa configuration
      parameters: []
      responses:
        '201':
          description: ''
      tags:
      - payments
    parameters: []
  /payments/mpesa/initialize/:
    post:
      operationId: payments_mpesa_initialize_create
      summary: Initialize M-Pesa Payment
      description: "\nInitialize M-Pesa payment for booking or late fee with optimized
        performance.\n\n**Performance Optimizations:**\n- Connection pooling for faster
        requests\n- Token caching (eliminates repeated OAuth calls)\n- Optimized database
        queries\n- Sub-second response times\n\n**Payment Methods:**\n- **STK Push**:
        Online payment with instant prompt (this endpoint)\n- **C2B Offline**: Automatic
        processing via webhooks (no manual selection)\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. Student
        provides phone number\n2. System initiates STK Push\n3. Customer enters M-Pesa
        PIN on phone\n4. Payment confirmed via webhook\n5. Booking confirmed automatically\n\n**C2B
        Alternative:**\nStudents can also pay via M-Pesa menu using:\n- Business Number:
        Platform Shortcode\n- Amount: Transaction Amount  \n- Reference: Transaction
        Reference\n\nProcessing is completely automatic via webhooks.\n"
      parameters:
      - name: data
        in: body
        required: true
        schema:
          required:
          - booking_id
          - payment_method
          - phone_number
          type: object
          properties:
            booking_id:
              description: Unique booking identifier
              type: integer
              example: 123
            payment_type:
              description: Payment type
              type: string
              enum:
              - initial
              - late_fee
              default: initial
              example: initial
            payment_method:
              description: Payment method (only STK Push supported)
              type: string
              enum:
              - stk_push
              default: stk_push
              example: stk_push
            phone_number:
              description: 'Customer phone number (format: 254XXXXXXXXX)'
              type: string
              example: '254712345678'
            late_fee_id:
              description: Late fee identifier (required if payment_type is late_fee)
              type: integer
              example: 456
          example:
            booking_id: 123
            payment_type: initial
            payment_method: stk_push
            phone_number: '254712345678'
      responses:
        '200':
          description: M-Pesa payment initialized successfully
          schema:
            type: object
            properties:
              transaction_id:
                type: integer
                example: 789
              transaction_reference:
                type: string
                example: RUMI-INITIAL-123-abc12345
              amount:
                type: number
                example: 15000.0
              payment_method:
                type: string
                example: mpesa
              mpesa_payment_type:
                type: string
                example: stk_push
              phone_number:
                type: string
                example: '254712345678'
              checkout_request_id:
                type: string
                example: ws_co_123456789
              merchant_request_id:
                type: string
                example: mr_123456789
              status:
                type: string
                example: pending_stk_push
              message:
                type: string
                example: STK push initiated. Please check your phone for payment prompt.
              c2b_alternative:
                type: object
                properties:
                  note:
                    type: string
                  business_number:
                    type: string
                  amount:
                    type: string
                  reference:
                    type: string
        '400':
          description: Bad Request - Invalid input data
        '401':
          description: Unauthorized - Authentication required
        '404':
          description: Not Found - Booking or late fee not found
        '500':
          description: Internal Server Error - M-Pesa API error
      tags:
      - Payments
    parameters: []
  /payments/mpesa/status/:
    get:
      operationId: payments_mpesa_status_list
      summary: Check M-Pesa Payment Status
      description: |2

        Check the current status of an M-Pesa payment transaction.

        **Supported Payment Types:**
        - **STK Push**: Online payments initiated via this platform
        - **C2B**: Offline payments made via M-Pesa menu

        **Status Updates:**
        - For STK Push: Queries M-Pesa API for real-time status
        - For C2B: Returns transaction status from webhook processing

        **Performance:**
        - Fast database queries with optimized lookups
        - Minimal payload processing
        - Quick response times

        **Authentication:**
        - Students can only check their own transactions
        - Admins can check any transaction
      parameters:
      - name: transaction_id
        in: query
        description: Transaction ID to check
        required: false
        type: integer
      - name: checkout_request_id
        in: query
        description: STK Push checkout request ID to check
        required: false
        type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Payment status retrieved successfully
          schema:
            type: object
            properties:
              transaction:
                description: Complete transaction object
                type: object
              status:
                type: string
                enum:
                - pending
                - success
                - failed
                example: success
              last_updated:
                type: string
                format: date-time
                example: '2024-01-01T12:00:00Z'
        '400':
          description: Bad Request - Invalid parameters
        '401':
          description: Unauthorized - Authentication required
        '403':
          description: Forbidden - Access denied to transaction
        '404':
          description: Not Found - Transaction not found
        '500':
          description: Internal Server Error
      tags:
      - Payments
    parameters: []
